    "description": "The Banking Accounts Unfreeze API allows for the management of account status by enabling the unfreezing of multiple bank accounts in a batch operation. This API supports financial institutions and service providers in efficiently reactivating accounts that may have been previously frozen due to compliance or security issues. Typical use cases involve restoring account access for clients or expediting business operations following a resolution of the underlying issue. Through the use of this endpoint, developers can streamline account management processes and improve client service delivery.",
